      "value": "I will write a complete list below.\n\nIf you do not want to access it, you need to set up a DNS server and take measures yourself until VRChat responds.\n\nVideoPlayer https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist\n\nassets.vrchat.com (It's official, but it's not on the whitelist. It was on ImageLoading. Why?)\n\n*.v-market.work\n\nmusic4.cdn.vket.com\n\nmixcloud.com\n\ntwisteventsasia.com\n\nstream.broadcast.unity.com\n\n*.furality.online\n\nlive.foxcdn.io\n\n*.xr-marketplace.com\n\n*.v-market.work\n\n*.vket.chat\n\nImageLoading https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/image-loading\n\n*.xr-marketplace.com\n\n*.v-market.work\n\n*.vket.chat\n\nString Loading https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/string-loading\n\napi.fynn.ai\n\napi-dev.fynn.ai\n\n*.xr-marketplace.com\n\n*.v-market.work\n\n*.vket.chat\n\nThe above list may not be up to date.\n\nPlease refer to the following URL for the latest list.\n\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/config\n\nMy main wish is that the whitelist should not be changed without the user's knowledge, and if there is a change in the whitelist, the documentation should be updated and there should be an announcement on the official Discord, etc.",
